          "layout": "read",
          "reveal": "lines",
          "hold": 5000,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "p",
              "text": "既然我们已经花了六天腾出空间、处理信息、让联系成形，你就可以从充盈感、而不是义务感出发去创造了。",
              "pids": [
                "p118"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "pids": [
            "p118",
            "p118"
          ]
        },
        {
          "layout": "read",
          "reveal": "lines",
          "hold": 6500,
          "list": {
            "ordered": false,
            "start": 1,
            "items": [
              {
                "zh": "毫无计划地做点东西。写作、画画、录一段 20 分钟的语音备忘，或者不看菜谱做饭。唯一的规则是没有规则。不要战略思考，也不要试图找到完美的角度。起个头，然后顺着它走。",
                "en": "Make something with no plan. Write, draw, record a 20-minute voice note, or cook without a recipe. The only rule is no rules. No strategic thinking or trying to find the perfect angle. Start a thread and follow it.",
                "pids": [
                  "p119"
                ]
              },
              {
                "zh": "不要分享它。我知道这和我一贯宣扬的相反，但我们需要记起：没有那些无声的意见影响你的方向，是什么感觉。留意一下，做出一样属于你自己的东西是什么感觉。",
                "en": "Don’t share it. I know this is antithetical to what I preach, but we need to remember what it’s like to not have silent opinions influencing your direction. Notice how it feels to have made something that’s yours.",
                "pids": [
                  "p120"
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
