                "zh": "它必须对你重要。你的模式识别是由情感投入驱动的。一个因为\"纸面上好看\"而选择的项目——比如一个你并不真正在乎的高薪学位——不会像那个真正让你夜不能寐的项目一样激活同样的雷达。",
                "en": "It has to matter to you. Your pattern recognition is powered by emotional investment. A project you chose because it “looks good on paper” - like a high paying degree that you don’t actually care about - won’t activate the same radar as the one that genuinely keeps you up at night.",
